_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s}_{⏟}}_{\\text{particular solution}},\n$$\n\nwhere $x({t}_{0})$ is the initial condition vector. \n\nLet's evaluate each part separately:\n\n- First, we find the homogeneous part. We are given that \n\n$$\n{e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSince the initial conditions are given at $t={t}_{0}=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})} & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Next, we find the particular solution. Notice that \n\n$$\n{e}^{A(t-s)}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ 7\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}7\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ 7\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}]\\text{d}s \\\\  & ={[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7(t-s)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7(t-s))\\end{aligned}]}_{s=0}^{s=t} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396731 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396732 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396733 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396734 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186396734 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396730 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0c3839e0-7572-5b48-a67f-8007a8d31b72" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396731 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)+1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396731 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396731 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "556a1d6d-0b97-5b9c-919a-ffcaef348e99" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396732 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t)-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396732 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396732 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "47177d5f-d60d-5a76-a622-4448eaae8c59" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396733 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)+1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396733 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396733 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7b9b3be8-96e2-584f-b6b0-e44dcfa5b59f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396734 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396734 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396734 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5e17787c-fdb3-5dc6-9f7d-ad11c18b5f0b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396771 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396772 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396771 #e